WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.109
- So, President Trump has
sent a cease and desist letter

00:00:02.109 --> 00:00:05.090
to the RNC saying that
they can't use his name

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:07.750
and likeness for fundraising purposes.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.930
Trump has sent many cease and
desist letters in the past,

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.400
and often they have resulted

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.740
in absolutely nothing whatsoever.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.850
So you might think that
this cease and desist letter

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:15.950
is also meritless,

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.120
but there might actually
be something to this.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.020
Just because Trump was president

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.800
doesn't mean he can't use his
name and likeness anymore.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.757
Individuals often can
control the monetization

00:00:24.757 --> 00:00:25.940
of their likeness.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:27.470
Now, some jurisdictions say that

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:29.101
if you are a celebrity or a politician,

00:00:29.101 --> 00:00:32.420
you can't sue for
misappropriation of likeness,

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.450
you're a public figure.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.810
But most jurisdictions
say that even politicians

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:37.181
or celebrities can still monetize

00:00:37.181 --> 00:00:39.480
and control the use of their likeness.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:41.340
It just depends on whether
their likeness is being used

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:43.370
for exploitative purposes or not.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:45.900
And fundraising emails from the RNC

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.581
probably qualify as exploitative

00:00:47.581 --> 00:00:50.420
and Trump might be on legal footing

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:51.820
if he wants to prevent them

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:53.580
from using his name and likeness.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:56.190
So, this likeness is
telling you to subscribe,

00:00:56.190 --> 00:00:58.153
or I will see you in court.

